(1. PURPOSE) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how raw material sampling is carried out at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SCOPE) Tj T*
(Applies to all raw material sampling activities in production and quality control at Northfield \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. RESPONSIBILITIES) Tj T*
(The process owner, Noor Galloway, maintains this procedure. the site lead approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Step 1: Record the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Inspect the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Confirm the batch number.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Clean the logbook entry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. RECORDS) Tj T*
(Records of raw material sampling are kept for five years after batch expiry \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
